@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### 1) Get a token (manager has the catalog-manager role)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "manager", "password": "Takwene@2026" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Who am I?
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List artists (anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/artists

### Create artist (JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/artists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Hana Mostafa", "email": "hana.mostafa@example.com", "country": "EG" }

### List DSPs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dsps

### List tracks with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks?status=distributed&genre=mahraganat&page=1&pageSize=20

### Validation error example (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks?status=published

### Track details — replace the id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create track (JWT) — replace artistId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Masr El Gedida",
  "artistId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "isrc": "EG-TKW-26-00042",
  "releaseDate": "2026-12-01",
  "genre": "Arabic Pop"
}

### Distribute (JWT) — replace ids
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/distribute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dspIds": [ "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000" ] }

### Update status (JWT)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tracks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "distributed" }

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
